#AREA Ethshar~
#AUTHORS Jaxom  ~





#HELPS
-1 ETHSHAR~
ETHSHAR
The Hegemony of Ethshar was founded by the three surviving generals
after the Great War ended.  The largest and grandest of the three
Ethshars is Ethshar of the Spices, which was founded and ruled by
Admiral Azrad.  Ethshar lies off of the Gulf of the East on the
continent of Toril.
.
.     (a) Jaxom
.
Last updated August 20, 1998

{a}JAXOM
~
0 $~




#RANGES 75 95 0 99
#MOBILES
#7500
valdermob innkeeper~
Valder~
Valder the Innkeeper is here.~
He is a young man who is fairly fit.  He looks at you as though you are
a child.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND
500 S
95 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 20d10+12000 4d5+90
356351 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
say Greetings, $n, I am Valder the Innkeeper.
if rand(20)
  say I am sometimes known as Valder of the Magic Sword.
endif
~
>speech_prog sword wirikidor~
say You wish to know the story of my sword, Wirikidor?
mpecho Valder pauses to decide where to begin.
say Long ago during the Great War, I was a scout in the Army.
say On a mission in the north I was cut off and trapped.
say It was then that I met a hermit that happened to be a wizard.
say He enchanted my sword in order to get rid of me.  
say Unfortunately his spell misfired and the enchantment on the 
say sword didn't quite work out right.  I figure I have about
say 14 uses of the sword left.
~
>fight_prog 15~
if rand(10)
  mpechoat $n To late you see Wirikidor coming for your head!
  if quest(24, 4, $n) < 14
    mpmadd $n quest 24 4 1
  endif
  slay $n
else
  mpechoat $n You barely avoid a vicious slash.  This guy is good!
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(24, 4, $n) == 14
  mpoload 7502
  mpmset $n quest 24 4 15
else
  if quest(24, 4, $n) == 15
  else
    mpmadd $n quest 24 4 1
    mpecho Valder falls to the ground motionless, but you cant get his sword.
  endif
endif
~
|
#7501
seremquestmob wise wizard~
Serem~
Serem the Wise is here.~
He is an aging wizard, but from the richness of his clothes you would
guess he is a master of his craft.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 20d10+12000 4d5+90
364841 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
mpecho Serem turns and sees you spying on him.
say What are you doing in my house?? You will die for
say trying to divine the secrets of the Wizard's Guild!
mpkill $n
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if time() == 0
  if quest(15, 4, $n) == 0
    mpecho You are amazed at your luck as Serem begins to teach his
    mpecho apprentice the secret of the athame.
    say You must have a place where you will be uninterupted.
    say You need a fine silver dagger with no imperfections.
    mpecho Serem explains to his apprentice how to CLEAN the dagger to get
    mpecho it ready for the ritual.
    mpmset $n quest 15 4 1
  else
    if quest(15, 4, $n) == 2
      mpecho You settle down to watch Serem at his instruction.
      mpecho This part of the ritual involves lighting a candle and
      mpecho the gestures involved in the second stage, including how
      mpecho to DRAW on the candles with dragon's blood.
      mpmset $n quest 15 4 3
    else
      if quest(15, 4, $n) == 4
        mpecho Serem reviews the ritual with his apprentice before teaching
        mpecho her the final words that she must speak.
        mpmset $n quest 15 4 5
      endif
    endif
  endif
else
  if quest(15, 4, $n) == 0
    mpecho You overhear Serem the Wise telling his apprentice that her
    mpecho lesson will begin at midnight tonight.
  endif
~
>rand_prog 25~
if quest(15, 4, $r) == 1
  say We will continue with the lesson tomorrow night.  
  mpmset $r quest 15 4 2
else
  if quest(15, 4, $r) == 3
    say Once you are holding the dagger and have lit the candle, you
    say recite the final verbal part of the ritual, but that will have
    say to wait until tomorrow night
    mpmset $r quest 15 4 4
  else
    if quest(15, 4, $r) == 5
      say falkmun awoglik olbaird varerel
      mpecho You watch as the apprentice goes through the entire ritual.
      mpmset $r quest 15 4 6
    else
      if quest(15, 4, $r) == 6
        mpecho As the apprentice finishes the ritual the dagger begins to glow.
        mpecho Serem the Wise glances up as his apprentice finishes
        mpecho creating her athame and sees you.
        say You will die for daring to learn the secrets of
        say the Wizard's Guild.
        mpmset $r quest 15 4 7
        mpkill $r
      endif
    endif
  endif
~
>fight_prog 40~
cast 'acid blast' $n
cast 'tremor' $r
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(15, 4, $n) == 7
  if quest(24, 1, $n) == 0
    mpoload 7520
    mpoload 7521
    mpmset $n quest 24 1 1
  endif
endif
~
|
