#7505
recruiter~
a Recruiter~
A Recruiter is here shouting to all who will listen.~
He is a large man with an even larger voice.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 20d10+12000 4d5+90
386387 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 100~
if rand(15)
  say Brave adventurers needed!
  say Sign up here!
else
  if rand(15)
    say Experienced dragon hunters wanted!
    say Sign up here!
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p sign up~
emote mutters 'finally!'
say A dragon has been rampaging and destroying crops and
say livestock in the vicinity of Akalla of the Diamond.  A heroic
say dragon slayer is wanted to track down and destroy the beast.
say I will pay you 2 million gold coins if on delivery of proof
say of a dead dragon.
mpmset $n quest 8 2 1
endif
~
>give_prog i7513~
if quest(8, 2, $n) == 2
  say You have indeed slain the dragon.  Here is the pay you were promised.
  mpoload 7518
  give diamond $n
  mpoload 7519
  give diamond $n
  smirk 
  say There you go.  2 million gold worth.
  mpjunk all
endif
~
