#7595
Heremon's Magic Shop~
This magic shop is cluttered with various jars and bottles, scrolls
and wands.  Every inch of floor space is covered and most of the wall
space as well.  There is a small desk in one corner of the room that
once you peer over the stack of paper there, you can see the proprietor
behind.~
